    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "This litter bag is rarely used for its orig\ninal purpose - so we thought we'd put\nit to some utilitarian use.\nCare for a\ngame of cards? Your Braniff hostess has\na deck she'll let you use. And here's a\nscore card, ready made for gin rummy\nINDIVIDUAL SCORES\nPLAYERS\n1st Game\n2nd Game\n3rd Game\nTOTALS\nPLAYER\nPLAYER\nPLAYER\nPLAYER\nTOTAL",
